replace: first <= day && day < last
caught-by:
    cortex-stats::it ranges::a_range_ends_at_the_local_midnight_on_either_side
    cortex-stats::it ranges::today_is_the_users_today_not_utcs

[break] the-day-is-utcs-not-the-users
rule: A moment's local date is taken at the zone's offset at that moment.
