caught-by:
    cortex-base::lib zone::tests::a_fixed_zone_moves_the_date_at_its_own_midnight
    cortex-stats::it store::an_event_goes_to_its_month_with_the_local_day_it_fell_on
    cortex-stats::it ranges::today_is_the_users_today_not_utcs

[break] summer-time-ignored
rule: A zone's rule changes its offset on its days: summer time is an hour ahead.
