replace: Some(_) => Ok(()),
caught-by:
    cortex-core::it usage::a_provider_with_no_documented_endpoint_has_no_refresh_and_only_a_user_may_ask

[break] the-key-follows-a-redirect
rule: No credential goes past its own host: the transport follows no redirect.
